Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:47.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（物种起源 作者）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.64,0:00:48.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（查尔斯·达尔文 文学硕士）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:54.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（缅因号战舰因不明生物 引起爆炸事故）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:56.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（声纳系统发现不明物体）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.32,0:00:56.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（灾难）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.04,0:00:57.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（失踪潜艇最后现身处）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.96,0:00:58.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（政府否认第三起失踪事件）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.08,0:01:11.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（比基尼岛）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.08,0:01:14.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（帝王计划）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:15.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿尔贡国立实验室）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.60,0:01:16.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（辐射区域）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.76,0:01:19.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（帝王怪兽）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.36,0:01:21.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（帝王计划）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.12,0:01:32.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（高危爆炸物）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.48,0:02:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,十\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.64,0:02:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,九 八\N{\fnArial\fs30}…nine, eight…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.12,0:02:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,七 六\N{\fnArial\fs30}…seven, six…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.20,0:02:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,五 四\N{\fnArial\fs30}…five, four…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二\N{\fnArial\fs30}…three, two…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.28,0:02:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}…one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.96,0:02:40.47,Title,0,0,0,0,,《哥斯拉》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:06.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1999年 菲律宾）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:41.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（环球西部矿业）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是芹泽博士吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Serizawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.92,0:03:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是杰瑞·博伊德 我来提醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jerry Boyd. I'm warning you, it's a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.16,0:04:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况非常糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a total mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.76,0:04:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,今早我奉命来查看情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monarch sent me in this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.48,0:04:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉他们 我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took a look around, but I told them we needed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.00,0:04:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,上个月矿工们发现了放射性矿囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}They picked up a radiation pocket out here last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很激动 以为找到了铀矿床\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got excited, thinking they had a uranium deposit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.80,0:04:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始往这里调集大型机械\N{\fnArial\fs30}They started stacking up the heavy machinery and then…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.68,0:04:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 谷底…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the valley floor…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然发生塌陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}…collapsed into a cavern below.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.76,0:04:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,掉进了地下洞穴 全都没了 都不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just dropped away. Just gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.52,0:04:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,初步统计有四十名矿工被埋在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best guess right now is about 40 miners went down with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,要进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.32,0:04:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们这儿刚发现放射性矿囊的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they first discovered this pocket,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.54,0:04:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,辐射强度只有现在的一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}the radiation levels were only half as strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.28,0:04:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是一接触到外面的空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost as if contact with the outside air…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.04,0:04:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就加速了某种反应的进程\N{\fnArial\fs30}…started catalyzing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.08,0:05:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是某种化石 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of fossils, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.04,0:05:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挖矿三十多年了 从没见过这样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been digging holes for 30 years, I've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.20,0:05:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上帝 这怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Is it possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,会是它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.20,0:05:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.24,0:05:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿比它可老多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is much older.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.28,0:05:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天呐 伙计们 快来看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys. You gotta see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.48,0:05:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,某种蛋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of egg?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:05:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,休眠中的孢子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dormant spore?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.24,0:06:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,骨骼已经变成了化石\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bones are fossilized…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.72,0:06:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个却没有 这个构造被完整地保留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but this formation seems to be perfectly preserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.44,0:06:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个看上去破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one looks broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有东西…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like something…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.84,0:06:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}…came out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.68,0:06:50.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（日本 雀路罗镇）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.96,0:07:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来接 可能是找我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get it. It's probably for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.24,0:07:09.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（生日快乐）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.40,0:07:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.52,0:07:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 明石先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Takashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 明石先生 你先听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Takashi, just listen to me for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.44,0:07:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请求面谈 因为我必须关闭核反应堆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking for the meeting because if I have to shut the reactor down…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望 你在事后才知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you're not gonna want to read about it in a memo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.56,0:07:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从菲律宾开始 就一直在跟踪研究这些震动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been following these tremors since they started in the Philippines…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在都震到家门口了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and now they're in our own backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 隼人说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Hayato says…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.40,0:07:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要先跟你沟通一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I need to go through you about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.44,0:07:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm just…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.80,0:07:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵守公司规章制度 没别的意思 这是我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}…trying to follow the protocols set forth by the company. That's all. It's my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.68,0:07:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.28,0:07:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 他早就醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know. He got up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.24,0:07:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿好衣服 我来想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get dressed. I'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吗 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:07:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.48,0:08:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,明石先生 我很尊重你\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect, Takashi, and honor…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬佩你 发自内心地敬重你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…respect and honor, with all of that…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可作为工程师 我不能容忍在我负责的范围内\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm an engineer. I don't like unexplained frequency patterning…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.76,0:08:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,存在无法解释的波段结构 我需要当面谈请你理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}…near a plant where I'm responsible. I need a meeting. Make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.04,0:08:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye. Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.12,0:08:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给你做了个徽章\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made you a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.96,0:08:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你的生日徽章\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Your birthday sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他花了很多心思 - 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He worked so hard. - Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.32,0:08:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天早点儿回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna come home early.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.88,0:08:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,先开车去接他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take the car and pick him up…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.80,0:08:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后去买生日蛋糕 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and we can get a proper cake. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.84,0:08:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我要知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I need to know…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.28,0:08:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是传感器的问题 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that it's not the sensors. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能在会议上表现的像个美国疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be calling this meeting and look like the American maniac.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以到那后\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when we get there…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别着急上楼 带人去地下五层看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}…don't even bother coming up. Just grab a team and go down to Level 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.68,0:08:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a maniac.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你在这个问题上没疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you are, just not about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们肯定是忽视了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be something we're not thinking of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.92,0:09:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 难道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Is it…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.76,0:09:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 没错 - 我都忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, it is. Ha, ha. - Oh, I forgot all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.28,0:09:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 生日快乐 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Happy birthday. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好天天过生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have a birthday more often. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.72,0:09:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 地震波异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is this? - Seismic anomaly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.36,0:09:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间单位是分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}This graph is minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,X轴是分钟不是天数 这是刚出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}X is minutes, not days. This is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 地震波异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, hold on. Seismic activity?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.12,0:09:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是说 这是地震的前兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seismic? You're talking about earthquakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.48,0:09:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 地震波是杂乱的 锯齿状\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, earthquakes are random, jagged.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.12,0:09:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是有规律的 在增强\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is consistent, increasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.92,0:09:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,波形很明显\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了安全措施
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,今日将召开紧急安全会议
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.72,0:09:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,都好了 我们动作快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's make this quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.76,0:09:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,会上将对安全措施进行详细说明
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.88,0:09:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,位置在第一休息室
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.08,0:09:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.24,0:10:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,明石 到底是怎么回事 这个你看了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takashi. What the hell is going on? Have you seen this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.72,0:10:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看了 现在不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Maybe not such…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.28,0:10:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,开会的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}…good time for a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.96,0:10:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,震源是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the source?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,震中在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the epicenter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.08,0:10:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不知道 但是一直在持续地增强\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know. But it keeps getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定能找到中心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gotta be centered somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,隼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.48,0:10:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人汇报过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one else is reporting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.72,0:10:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在跟中州\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are contacting every other plant in the Kanto region.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.80,0:10:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,东海和富士山所有的核电站联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tokai, Fujiyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.52,0:10:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没受影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're unaffected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.80,0:10:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我认为我们监测到的应该是 菲律宾地震的余震\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my guess is these readings are just aftershocks from the Philippine earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.64,0:10:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在超负荷工作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we at full function?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.28,0:10:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.60,0:10:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了安全起见 应该下调能量值\N{\fnArial\fs30}But perhaps we should be drawing down, to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须马上关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take us offline.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.44,0:10:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 乔 我们应该快点儿… - 彻底关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, Joe… - Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.60,0:10:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上动手 关闭反应堆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now. Wind it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.04,0:10:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑德拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sandra.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.44,0:10:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sandra, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.84,0:11:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.76,0:11:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,都快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.16,0:11:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.56,0:11:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔 你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,要发生泄漏了 我们要回到封闭舱去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe, there's been a breach. We're heading back to the containment seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑德拉 听我说 你们马上离开那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. You need to get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.92,0:11:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 如果核泄漏 即使穿着隔离服\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's been a reactor breach, you won't last five minutes…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.28,0:11:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也活不过五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with or without the suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.68,0:11:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.72,0:11:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见了 我们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you. We're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.64,0:11:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下去迎他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet them there myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把安全门调成手动控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the safety doors on manual override.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.64,0:11:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能那么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别关门 我妻子还在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the doors open. My wife is still in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.16,0:11:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.16,0:11:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家 快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}…let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.20,0:12:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,明石 启动…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me this door's…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.52,0:12:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,手动控制了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on manual.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.36,0:12:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,手动 是的 但是乔 已经开始泄漏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. But we are starting to breach!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.52,0:12:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿 他们到达后我来关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here. Soon as they're through, I'll seal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.04,0:12:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑德拉 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sandra, can you…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.16,0:12:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,能听见吗 我在门这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}…hear me? I'm at the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.52,0:12:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑德拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sandra?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑德拉 我在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sandra, I'm waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.24,0:12:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在安全门这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm at the checkpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得快跑 亲爱的 越快越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have to run as fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.12,0:12:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,铃木\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kenji. Kenji…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.48,0:12:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we need to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.48,0:12:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔 关闭安全门
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,明石 他们还没进来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.28,0:12:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,封闭通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.48,0:12:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则整座城都会被炸毁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seal the corridor or the whole city will be exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.64,0:12:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑德拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sandra?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乔 能听见吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Joe? Joe, can you hear me? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.88,0:12:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在吗 - 桑德拉 我在 你能听见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you there? - Sandra, I'm here. Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.72,0:12:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.48,0:12:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔 太晚了 我们回不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe, it's too late. We're not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么说 不要这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't say that! Don't you say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.52,0:12:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们快跑 我等你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run as hard as you can, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.92,0:13:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔 你必须关上安全门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe, you have to close the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.08,0:13:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要为我们的儿子活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to live for our son.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乔 封死门 快 - 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Joe, seal the door! Now! - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.68,0:13:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,五秒 四秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five seconds! Four seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.92,0:13:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.84,0:14:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顾好福特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of Ford.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,做个好爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a good father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.72,0:14:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I Will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.64,0:14:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他 我爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.28,0:14:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急情况 大家快出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 福特 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry! Come on! Ford!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:08.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（15年后）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.28,0:15:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,起立\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有家人在等你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got family waiting for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.00,0:15:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你离家多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you been away?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.48,0:15:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,十四个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fourteen months.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.08,0:15:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.28,0:15:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当是一个新的挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the one thing they don't train you for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.20,0:15:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.88,0:15:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就不告诉你 - 我能看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't tell you. - Can I see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.16,0:15:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.72,0:15:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.20,0:15:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欢迎你回家 - 天呐 快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a welcome home cake. - Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.80,0:15:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 另外那个是我 - 写的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And that's me. - What's it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.12,0:15:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎爸爸回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Welcome home, Daddy."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.76,0:15:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.72,0:15:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸回家 - 每晚都有蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daddy's home. - Cake every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.88,0:15:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 看把你美的 - 爸爸回家…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, that's not happening. - Daddy's home equals…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.80,0:15:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等于每晚都有蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}…cake every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.84,0:16:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么把巧克力吃到眼睛上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you manage to get chocolate on your eyeball?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.20,0:16:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是爸爸弄的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再闹我可就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't sleep with you…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.04,0:16:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不跟你一块睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…making all this noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 盖好被子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's get you into bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.92,0:16:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡吧 大个子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, big man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.00,0:16:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要服从命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to hit the rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.36,0:16:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.28,0:16:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.08,0:16:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明天还会在这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still gonna be here tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.72,0:16:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.68,0:16:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 快睡觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.88,0:16:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,转过来 就这么脸对脸 别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns around, nose-to-nose, he says, "At ease, lieutenant."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.16,0:16:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我天天在想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I missed your laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.08,0:17:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得接一下 别是医院的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should get that. No, it could be work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.76,0:17:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我接一下 - 你不必的 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need to get that. - You don't need to. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.44,0:17:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错 我是布罗迪太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this is Mrs. Brody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.56,0:17:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他 你正忙着满足丈夫的需要呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him you're busy tending to your husband's needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.28,0:17:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他是我丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.80,0:17:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他 我们什么都不想买\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them we're not gonna buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.84,0:17:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 先生 你能等一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. Could you just hold on one moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,领事馆打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the consulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.52,0:17:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔在日本被逮捕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe's been arrested in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.72,0:17:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽 我的裤子在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elle, I can't find my pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.32,0:17:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那个抽屉里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in the other drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.28,0:17:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么会擅闯隔离区\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why was he trespassing in the quarantine zone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.64,0:17:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh. Why do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.16,0:17:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找真相的孤胆英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lone crusader for the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.12,0:18:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没法理解他那些疯狂的理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}All his crackpot cuckoo theories.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.24,0:18:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲是个好人 他现在需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father is a good man. He just needs your help right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.72,0:18:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,福特 他已经什么都没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ford, he's lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.20,0:18:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我也一样 但我至少挺过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so did I. But you know what? I got over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.20,0:18:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.84,0:18:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. It's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.44,0:18:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次我跟他亲近 他就想把我拉回到过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I let him in close, he always tries to drag me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.56,0:18:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到 我不能让我的家人再受伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't. I can't put our family through that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.56,0:18:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他也是你的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he is your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.52,0:18:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只不过就离开几天而已 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you're only gonna be gone for a few days, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就会回到我身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you are gonna come back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.68,0:18:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.72,0:18:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不是世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:06.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（东京）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.00,0:19:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 光司 你这个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.88,0:19:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么别问了 快走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.28,0:19:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再这样会无可救药的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这不常有人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get many visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.88,0:20:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就睡这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.24,0:20:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even, uh, Ph.D.'s…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.84,0:20:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,做英语外教也赚不了多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}…don't get much teaching English as a second language.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.76,0:20:20.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（核危机持续恶化）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.72,0:20:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.04,0:20:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这毛巾是干净的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.40,0:20:24.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（熔毁 雀路罗电子公司欲盖弥彰）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.64,0:20:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.52,0:20:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.32,0:20:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹生意怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…how's the bomb business?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.24,0:20:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这年头儿这生意肯定红火\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be a growth area these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.80,0:20:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的工作叫做爆炸物处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called "explosive ordnance disposal."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.68,0:20:36.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1954年南太平洋的隐秘事件）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.56,0:20:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是投掷炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}My job isn't dropping bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.96,0:20:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stopping them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:42.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（隔离区 雀路罗镇周围戒备森严）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.80,0:20:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.52,0:20:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…how's Elle doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.28,0:20:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有萨姆 我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Sam. Oh, my God. He must be…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.52,0:20:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在多大了 三岁还是三岁半\N{\fnArial\fs30}…what? Three? Three and a half?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.40,0:20:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快五岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's almost 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.68,0:20:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为你已经想通了 回波定位法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were over this."Echolocation"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.20,0:20:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,种群间的沟通\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Parasitic communication…"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.40,0:21:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 别动这些 弄乱了我就找不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't, if you don't mind. I have everything the way I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在学习生物声学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just… I'm studying bioacoustics.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.00,0:21:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回到那地方去干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you doing, going back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.04,0:21:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所谓非法入侵根本就是胡说八道 - 你犯了法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This trespassing stuff, that was bull. - You broke the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.16,0:21:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想回我们以前住的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to get back to our old house.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可房子在隔离区 - 对 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In a quarantine zone. - Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.08,0:21:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的数据跟那天一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new readings are exactly like they were on that day…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.12,0:21:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以证明给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I can prove it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.72,0:21:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果够走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a little luck, if I can get back…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.92,0:21:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我回到那房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to the house…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.36,0:21:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以给全世界证明这不是自然灾害 不是地震波异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I can show you and the world this was not from a natural disaster. This was…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.32,0:21:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.88,0:21:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈留在了那里 福特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom's out there, Ford.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:21:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.08,0:21:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一直在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}…she'll always be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.92,0:22:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初撤离的太仓促\N{\fnArial\fs30}They evacuated us so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.24,0:22:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至连她的照片都没留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even have a picture of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.76,0:22:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能再这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.60,0:22:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我已经尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I did everything I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.20,0:22:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.36,0:22:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.40,0:22:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come home with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.92,0:22:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里有个男孩在盼着他的爷爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a little boy who's desperate to see his grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.08,0:22:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明天就动身\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can leave tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.80,0:22:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 大致情况就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.16,0:22:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.00,0:22:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,具体的细节 还是见面再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.88,0:22:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧 我尽快赶到那里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.24,0:23:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要过来 最好快点儿 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.00,0:23:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 再见 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.76,0:23:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.28,0:23:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得再去那儿一次 福特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm heading back out there, Ford.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.16,0:23:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 我不同意你去 - 一个小时就能回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. I don't think so. - One hour, in and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.44,0:23:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.40,0:23:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回到这里 花了六年的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came back here and wasted six years…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.52,0:23:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,望着那片铁丝网\N{\fnArial\fs30}…staring through that barbed wire, thinking it was…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.28,0:23:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可能是场军事事故或者是因为设计上\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a military mistake or some horrible design flaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.21,0:23:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有大失误所以他们要掩盖真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were covering up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.28,0:23:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.32,0:23:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我遇见个在近海跑船运的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I met a guy who runs a cargo boat offshore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.60,0:23:43.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（声学专家声称揭穿「奇怪的噪音」之谜）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.16,0:23:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他每天都会经过反应堆那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day he goes right past the reactor site.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.92,0:23:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让他替我在浮标上放置了频率监测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he places a couple frequency monitors on buoys for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,两周前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two weeks ago…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.28,0:23:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,每隔一天我都会检查 反正闲着也是闲着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I check this thing like every other day just for the kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.32,0:23:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,两周前 调节频率时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two weeks ago, I'm tuning in…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.60,0:24:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and, oh, my God…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.00,0:24:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.72,0:24:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管到底是什么 它就在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever "it" is that's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.16,0:24:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他们小心翼翼把守着的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is they're guarding so carefully…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.28,0:24:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西又说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…started talking again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.28,0:24:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见它在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I mean talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.44,0:24:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须回到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go back…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.72,0:24:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.84,0:24:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找回我的磁盘 如果还在的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need my old disks, if they're still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.80,0:24:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面的数据 跟这次的数据对比就能证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the data to be able to prove a baseline here…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.76,0:24:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的观点不是凭空妄想 我不是你想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that this isn't a fantasy, that I'm not what you think I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.56,0:24:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna find the truth…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.44,0:24:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,了断这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.72,0:24:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论代价是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.48,0:24:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你就不肯罢手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't you just let it rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.24,0:24:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我让你妈妈下去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I sent her down there, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.60,0:24:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,事故的原因没那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}This wasn't just a reactor meltdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.52,0:24:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再听了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna hear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.00,0:24:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 知道你不想听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.68,0:24:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不能永远回避问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't keep running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.00,0:25:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能把这一切跟过去一起埋葬\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, son, you can't bury this in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.76,0:25:31.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（隔离区）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.84,0:25:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在怕什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What spooked them?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.80,0:26:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 快点走吧 还有两个街区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, come on. Let's go. It's only another two blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.28,0:26:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.48,0:26:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还去不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we going home, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.28,0:26:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.32,0:26:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.88,0:26:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,很干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.76,0:26:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.28,0:26:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿的辐射指数本该是致命的 但却什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}The radiation in this place should be lethal, but there's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.48,0:27:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.32,0:27:45.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（生日快乐）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.08,0:28:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是要重建核电站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they rebuilding the plant?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.12,0:28:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 我没看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I haven't seen…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.12,0:28:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,五号车抓到入侵者 请求带往本部
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.48,0:28:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在干什么 不许动 你们知道后果吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.20,0:28:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.84,0:29:05.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（雀路罗）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.48,0:29:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到入侵者
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.28,0:29:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,停
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.48,0:29:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们前往第四栋 - 好的 通行
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.04,0:29:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten seconds. Ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.12,0:29:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备放水 拜托了 快点呼叫增援
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.16,0:29:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,加大压力 红色小组请进入警戒状态
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.56,0:30:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,七点二秒 越来越强烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven-point-two seconds and getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.08,0:30:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,以指数趋势增涨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trending exponentially.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.00,0:30:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是新高\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our new curve.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.96,0:30:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 比想象的还糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, it's worse than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.24,0:30:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 芹泽博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, Dr. Serizawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.76,0:30:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚抓到两名入侵者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men were just arrested in the Q-zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.84,0:30:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这儿有更重要的事情 让格雷厄姆博士处理吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got bigger problems here. Have Dr. Graham take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.88,0:30:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在处理 她让我通知你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did, sir. She sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.92,0:30:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个人说他以前在这里工作过\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them says he used to work here, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.48,0:30:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要再撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not fooling anybody…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.44,0:30:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,十五年前 你跟大家说这是自然灾害\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when you say that what happened 15 years ago…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.28,0:30:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他包里发现了这些磁盘和资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found these disks in his bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.74,0:30:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是地震\N{\fnArial\fs30}…was a natural disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.64,0:30:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道该怎么处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sure what to make of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.28,0:30:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是台风 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not an earthquake, it wasn't a typhoon. Okay? So stop…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.00,0:30:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别费劲了 我懒得再跟你浪费口舌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm tired of talking to you about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.36,0:30:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要见我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.60,0:30:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要见我儿子 确保他没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna see my son. I wanna know that he's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.72,0:30:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy, this guy knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.28,0:30:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.80,0:30:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要见我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.04,0:30:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的包和磁盘还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want my bag and disks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.68,0:31:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟这里的负责人说话 不是你 不 不跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wanna talk to somebody in charge, not you. No, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.76,0:31:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想跟你废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.92,0:31:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了吗 我知道你们正在看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? You're looking at me right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.74,0:31:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我在水族箱里一样 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}like I'm in a fish tank, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.56,0:31:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓 因为我知道这里发生过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Because I know what happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.80,0:31:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一直对外声称\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you keep telling everybody that this place…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.72,0:31:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是死亡地带 但事实不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is a death zone, but it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.96,0:31:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.40,0:31:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为事情的真相是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because what's really happening…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.40,0:31:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在这里藏匿了什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is that you're hiding something out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.96,0:31:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说对了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.28,0:31:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子就死在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife died here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.32,0:31:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是被杀死在这儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something killed my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.96,0:31:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有权…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.88,0:31:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a right to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.64,0:31:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有权知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deserve answers!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.68,0:31:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些磁盘和资料…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these items…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.04,0:31:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我检查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they were found on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.24,0:31:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 日期是十五年前的 - 我以为那天…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And the date. Look, 15 years ago. - I thought all of the data…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.68,0:31:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的数据都已经被毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…from that day was lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.92,0:31:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.72,0:32:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.44,0:32:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,又出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? There it is again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.68,0:32:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是变压器发生故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not a transformer malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.84,0:32:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝对是一种电磁脉冲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is an electromagnetic pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.72,0:32:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好几英里之内一切电器…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It affects everything electrical…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.32,0:32:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会受到影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for miles and miles…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.84,0:32:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and it is happening again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.84,0:32:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是最初发生事故的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what caused everything in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.44,0:32:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还不明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.20,0:32:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会把我们直接送回石器时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is gonna send us back to the Stone Age.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.64,0:32:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就要大难临头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.56,0:32:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,脉冲几秒钟一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulses are seconds apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.64,0:32:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,越来越强 会影响到电网\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're getting stronger. It's affecting the power grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.08,0:32:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有辐射泄漏迹象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any radiation leakage?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.32,0:32:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,伽玛读数仍然为零\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gamma levels are still zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.12,0:32:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把三个反应堆都吸干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sucked all three reactors dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.36,0:32:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.64,0:32:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,它结束进食了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's done feeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.76,0:32:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.08,0:33:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上帝 同样的波形 - 十五年前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's the same pattern. - Fifteen years ago…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.26,0:33:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它就是罪魁祸首 - 电磁脉冲…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …it's what caused the meltdown. - An electromagnetic…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.32,0:33:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个手段 它在吸收能量 吸光所有辐射\N{\fnArial\fs30}…pulse. That's what it's building to. Converting all that radiation…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.18,0:33:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到破茧而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}…until it hatches.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.92,0:33:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能再继续了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.32,0:33:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤出第一区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secure the grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.96,0:33:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动紧急预案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wildfire protocols.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.20,0:33:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人员 立即撤出第一区 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}All personnel, clear the first perimeter immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.80,0:33:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是演习 请无关人员 所有人员请立即前往避难所
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.76,0:33:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到的入侵者如何处置
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.68,0:33:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了你去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? Hey, where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.68,0:33:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grid's secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.36,0:34:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.84,0:34:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,波形成直线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All readings are flatlined.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.08,0:34:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,派人看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a visual.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.60,0:35:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 电网被电磁脉冲攻击 电全断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus. Check the grid. Hit us with an EMP. We're losing power!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.68,0:35:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 启动备用发电机 - 已经启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get the backup generators online. - Working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.32,0:35:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是脉冲线路瘫痪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That pulse fried every circuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.92,0:35:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 检查线路 - 再试备用发电机\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Check the cage. - Trying the backup generators.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.48,0:35:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.92,0:35:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody out!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.36,0:36:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.00,0:36:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Let me out! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.36,0:37:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.72,0:37:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.72,0:37:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,福特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ford!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.52,0:37:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.92,0:38:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是以前从没经历过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was unlike anything I've ever experienced before.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.36,0:38:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是福特·布罗迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's, uh, Ford Brody.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.36,0:38:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,从日本飞往旧金山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Japan to San Francisco.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.52,0:38:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我能不能 给您留下我的手机号码…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, could I at least… if you could let me leave you my cell…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.96,0:38:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.12,0:38:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.68,0:38:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.76,0:39:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.12,0:39:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Daddy's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.68,0:39:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.00,0:39:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个区域现在由军队接管\N{\fnArial\fs30}This area is now under Naval military jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.68,0:39:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如有疑问…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All personnel must report…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.36,0:39:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,请与当值军官联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to the duty officer for debriefing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.72,0:39:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,芹泽博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Serizawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.72,0:39:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,芹泽博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Serizawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.48,0:39:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,芹泽博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Serizawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.28,0:39:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是罗素·汉普顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Russell Hampton.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.36,0:39:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴能找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad to find you. I've been briefed…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.00,0:39:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对您正在参与的帝王计划有所了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on your work with Operation Monarch.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.00,0:39:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被告知您的机构对不明生物的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm told your organization has situational awareness…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.08,0:39:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经有了突破性的进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of our unidentified creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.20,0:39:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.16,0:39:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来通知你 帝王计划…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are now taking over operational authority…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.08,0:39:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在已经被我们军方接管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…from Monarch. So I'm gonna need you…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.28,0:39:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以请您跟我走一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.44,0:39:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要什么人协助你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any other personnel you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.72,0:40:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.24,0:40:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会一直陪着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.12,0:40:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.64,0:40:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.56,0:40:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 检查他的生命体征\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get his vitals.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.88,0:40:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 脉搏很微弱 心率每分钟125\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad. Dad. - Radial pulse is weak. I'm counting 125.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.96,0:40:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.20,0:40:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.16,0:40:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.12,0:40:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到家人身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go home to your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.56,0:40:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证他们的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep them safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.88,0:41:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吗 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.64,0:41:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.52,0:41:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it ta…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.00,0:41:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸别睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.16,0:41:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.16,0:41:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 脉搏在变弱 快感觉不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad? - Radial pulse is weaker. Barely feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.60,0:41:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're losing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.64,0:41:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乔 能听见吗 - 开始房颤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Joe, can you hear me? - He's going into A-fib.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.00,0:41:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一千毫克肾上腺素 四十个单位的加压素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me another epi, one milligram, and 40 units of vasopressin.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.52,0:41:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别睡 坚持住 乔 加油伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with us. Come on, Joe. Hang in there, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.80,0:41:30.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（美国海军萨拉托加号航母 日本海岸线）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.56,0:41:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直就是在大海捞针\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our needle in a haystack, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.16,0:41:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,穆托\N{\fnArial\fs30}MUTO.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.56,0:41:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,未明种类的巨型陆生生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Massive unidentified terrestrial organism.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.52,0:41:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在不再是陆生了 它会飞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is, however, no longer terrestrial. It is airborne.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.24,0:41:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在全世界都以为这是一场地震\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world still thinks this was an earthquake…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.68,0:41:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们最好的办法就是保持现状\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and it would be preferable that that remain so.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.20,0:41:47.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（六点三级地震波及日本东部）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.68,0:41:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,消失之前 它穿过太平洋往东面去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we lost sight, it was headed east across the Pacific…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.60,0:41:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,并发射出破坏力很强的电磁脉冲波\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and had emitted enough EMP disruption…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.80,0:41:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的雷达和卫星传送系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to create havoc with our radar and satellite feeds…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.64,0:41:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,都受到了严重的干扰 暂时只有视频可以追踪到\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and reduce us, for the moment, to a strictly visual pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.72,0:42:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我特别强调暂时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I emphasize "for the moment"…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.88,0:42:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为我们很快会恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}…because we will get on our game…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.24,0:42:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会找到这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and we will find this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.28,0:42:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是我们的职责所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is imperative that we do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.04,0:42:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,请把所有的搜寻方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, I want any…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.28,0:42:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尽快报上来 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …and all search options on this table ASAP. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.40,0:42:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,芹泽博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Serizawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.40,0:42:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是威廉·姆斯坦兹海军上将\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral William Stenz.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.96,0:42:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴认识您 - 欢迎加入我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice to meet you. - Glad to have you on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.44,0:42:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.00,0:42:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.64,0:42:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尽管死亡人数仍在增加… - 他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Authorities issued a statement… - Brody's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.12,0:42:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,当局发布了一份声明称…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…claiming the nuclear contamination…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.88,0:42:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,核污染并没有扩散\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is at no risk of spreading, even as the death toll rises.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.04,0:43:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,布罗迪中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant Brody?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.52,0:43:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,芹泽博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Serizawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.00,0:43:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,请您节哀\N{\fnArial\fs30}My condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.32,0:43:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,您父亲的事我们很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are deeply sorry for your loss, lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.92,0:43:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们需要您的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm afraid we need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.80,0:43:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是美国海军鹦鹉螺号\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the USS Nautilus.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.12,0:43:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,1954年\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 1954…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.36,0:43:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘核潜艇首次抵达前所未有的深度\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the first time a nuclear submarine ever reached the lower depths…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.20,0:43:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊醒了某种生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it awakened something.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.64,0:43:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国人最先以为是俄国人干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Americans first thought that it was the Russians.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.08,0:43:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄国人却以为是美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Russians thought that it was them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.80,0:43:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些五十年代进行的核弹试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those nuclear bomb tests in the '50s…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.68,0:43:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.72,0:43:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是想杀了这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were trying to kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.12,0:43:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.88,0:43:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个远古的掠食者之王 - 比人类…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- An ancient alpha predator. - Millions of years…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.00,0:43:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还早几百万年\N{\fnArial\fs30}…older than mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.56,0:44:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时地球上的放射性\N{\fnArial\fs30}From an age when the Earth…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.92,0:44:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,比现在强烈十倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}…was 10 times more radioactive than today.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.72,0:44:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只生物和它的同伴们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This animal and others like it…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.88,0:44:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,将放射物当成食品来使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}…consumed this radiation as a food source.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.76,0:44:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,随着地表的放射程度减弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the levels on the surface naturally subsided…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.32,0:44:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,逐渐适应了生活在海洋深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}…these creatures adapted to live deeper in the oceans.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.12,0:44:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下更深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Further underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.08,0:44:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,从星球的核心处获取放射物质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absorbing radiation from the planet's core.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.04,0:44:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为之工作的机构 帝王\N{\fnArial\fs30}The organization we work for, Monarch, was established…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.44,0:44:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是因为这个发现而建立的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the wake of this discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.84,0:44:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个秘密成立的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A multinational coalition…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.64,0:44:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,多国联合机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}…formed in secrecy…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.76,0:44:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,去搜寻它\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to search for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.60,0:44:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,研究它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Study him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.20,0:44:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,竭尽所能了解它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Learn everything we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.76,0:44:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们管它叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call him…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.92,0:44:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Gojira.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.40,0:44:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,原始生态系统的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The top of…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.48,0:44:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,最高统治者\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a primordial ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.24,0:44:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是神 无论从什么角度看\N{\fnArial\fs30}A god, for all intents and purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.28,0:44:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一只兽 - 十五年前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A monster. - Fifteen years ago…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.80,0:44:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在菲律宾 发现了另一头巨型动物的化石\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we found a fossil of another giant animal in the Philippines.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.60,0:44:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,很像哥斯拉 但它…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Gojira. But this creature…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.84,0:44:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…died long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.28,0:45:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,被它们杀死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killed by these.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.56,0:45:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是寄生孢子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parasitic spores.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.48,0:45:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个母体 其余是孵化的 一家矿产公司无意中…\N{\fnArial\fs30}One dormant. But the other hatched. Catalyzed when a mining company…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.16,0:45:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,挖到它们的巢穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}…unknowingly drilled into its tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.60,0:45:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,孵化洞穴直指距离最近的放射源所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hatchling burrowed straight for the nearest source of radiation…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.64,0:45:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲所在的雀路罗核电站\N{\fnArial\fs30}…your father's power plant in Janjira…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.44,0:45:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,并在其中孵化了十五年 利用那里的放射性燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and cocooned there for 15 years, absorbing its radioactive fuel…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.44,0:45:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 孕育 成长 - 直到今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …to gestate, to grow. - Until it hatched…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.44,0:45:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,像蝴蝶一样孵化成你看到的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}…like a butterfly into the creature you saw today.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.08,0:45:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你早就知道这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You knew about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.16,0:45:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个东西 一直都知道 为什么有机会的时候…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing? The whole time? Why didn't you…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.48,0:45:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没杀了它 - 它一直从反应堆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …kill it when you had the chance? - It was absorbing…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.98,0:45:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸收放射性物质\N{\fnArial\fs30}…radiation from the reactors.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.00,0:45:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们担心杀掉它…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We worried killing it…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.36,0:45:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,会释放出辐射 造成严重的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}…might release that radiation and endanger millions.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.52,0:45:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我们的任务是控制它\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why our mission was to contain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.20,0:45:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,研究它的生物性 了解它\N{\fnArial\fs30}To study its biology, to understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.72,0:45:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道这只生物 对它一定范围内的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We knew the creature was having an electrical effect…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.80,0:45:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,都具有电场效应\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on everything within a close proximity.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.08,0:45:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不知道的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we didn't know…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.28,0:45:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在电磁脉冲袭击方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}…was that it could harness this same power…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.88,0:45:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,具有同样的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in an EMP attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.84,0:45:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你父亲知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your father did.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.00,0:45:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他预测到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He predicted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.64,0:46:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还说过什么话\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.88,0:46:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,请好好想想 布罗迪先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please try to remember, Mr. Brody.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.40,0:46:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何话可能都有用 仔细想一想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything that would help us. Anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.96,0:46:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没太在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.20,0:46:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought he was crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.84,0:46:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他沉迷于这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was obsessed with all this…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.16,0:46:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么关于动物的交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said something about an animal call.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.12,0:46:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.20,0:46:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.08,0:46:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他在研究着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he was studying something.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.40,0:46:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,回波定位法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Echolocation.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.76,0:46:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那天穆托说过话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the MUTO was talking that day…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.84,0:46:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲肯定发现了什么东西在做回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}…your father must have discovered something talking back.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.40,0:46:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再查查 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Check again. - Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.04,0:46:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看是什么在回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Search for a response call.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.72,0:46:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This parasite.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.72,0:46:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还在那儿蛰伏着 接下来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still out there. Where's it headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.44,0:46:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,穆托很年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}The MUTO is young…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.28,0:46:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在生长\N{\fnArial\fs30}…growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.68,0:46:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来它会寻找食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be looking for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.80,0:46:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找放射源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sources of radiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.76,0:46:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在监测所有已知地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're monitoring all known sites…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.84,0:47:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不能尽快找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but if we don't find it soon…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.64,0:47:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.12,0:47:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,大自然有种能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nature has an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.60,0:47:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种重建平衡的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}A power to restore balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.28,0:47:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信它就是那种能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe he is that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.36,0:47:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我们目前距离夏威夷五十英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, right now we're 50 miles from Hawaii.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.32,0:47:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这架飞机会带您过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This transport will take you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.20,0:47:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有一架商务机带您返回旧金山\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're catching a commercial flight back to San Francisco.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.04,0:47:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该去刷牙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need you to brush your teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.76,0:47:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,太糟糕了 嘴里好多细菌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disgusting! Those are terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.88,0:47:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,再不刷就该臭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta brush them!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.12,0:47:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天然气和电力系统损毁严重 部分地区通讯中断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Citizens within a 100-mile radius…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.43,0:47:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,该地区方圆一百英里范围内的居民已被疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are being temporarily evacuated from the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.88,0:47:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是艾丽 我现在不在 有事请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, this is Elle. You missed me. Please leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.36,0:47:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elle.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.68,0:48:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他们在新闻上是怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what they're saying on the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.96,0:48:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在日本发生了一起事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was an accident in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.36,0:48:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.68,0:48:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等见了面再细说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll explain when I see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.28,0:48:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在去夏威夷 在那里搭机回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm headed to Hawaii. I'm gonna catch a flight from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.80,0:48:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快能见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.92,0:48:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续往下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep scrolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.24,0:48:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠近最后 在脉冲前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Near the end. Before the EMP.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.60,0:48:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.80,0:48:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西做出了回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something responded.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.60,0:48:43.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（夏威夷 檀香山）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.96,0:48:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,乘客您好 欢迎乘坐列车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aloha, and welcome aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.76,0:48:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,本次列车即将启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}The train will begin moving shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.24,0:48:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了他人着想请不要吸烟 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the comfort of others, no smoking, please. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.68,0:49:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了您的安全请勿倚靠车门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please remember to stay clear of the automatic doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.60,0:49:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,昭夫 不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Akio!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.96,0:49:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.48,0:49:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.84,0:49:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.00,0:49:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.00,0:49:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 请帮帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.64,0:49:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打不开门 小心 别担心 你们等在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't open it. Look, don't worry. Just wait there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.88,0:49:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带他回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.84,0:49:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.80,0:49:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.60,0:49:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.32,0:49:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 小孩 - 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa. Hey. Whoa, kid. - Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.40,0:49:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带他回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I'm gonna bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.40,0:49:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我会把你送回去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm gonna set you down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.72,0:49:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,带你回去找爸爸妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you back to your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.12,0:49:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.80,0:49:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 是不是很喜欢这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Is this what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.28,0:49:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我好好照顾他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take good care of him for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.00,0:49:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿别耽误我赶飞机 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I better not miss my flight, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.60,0:49:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 我们收到一份情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral, received an intel report.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.96,0:49:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在距离夏威夷五十英里的海域 有一艘俄罗斯核潜艇失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost track of a nuclear Akula 50 nautical miles northwest of Hawaii.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.28,0:49:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是穆托干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be the MUTO.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.76,0:49:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到消息 俄罗斯潜艇在北太平洋失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just got word of a missing Russian sub in the North Pacific.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.96,0:49:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁内兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martinez?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.16,0:50:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官 特种部队斯巴达一号收到呼救信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye. Special Forces Team Sparta 1 is picking up a distress signal…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.24,0:50:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在瓦胡岛 钻石头西北方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}…northwest of Diamond Head on the island of Oahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.52,0:50:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地面向灯塔方向移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're on the ground, headed to the beacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.56,0:50:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离上次讯号北北东五点二三\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on 5.23 north-northeast…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.72,0:50:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,正步行前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of the last beacon. Moving in on foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.48,0:50:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能告诉我为什么要在丛林里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna tell me why we're looking…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.32,0:50:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找一艘俄罗斯潜艇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for an Akula in the jungle?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.00,0:50:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准是错了 俄罗斯人说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably a glitch. Russians said they…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.16,0:50:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里收到了信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}…got a ping from this location.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.72,0:50:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收到信号了 就在正前方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I got a reading. It's right up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.68,0:50:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达一号 我是鹰眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sparta 1, this is Hawkeye.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.16,0:50:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们收到了同样的信号 范围三十米\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting the same ping off the transponder. Range 30 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.72,0:50:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你们接近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you're getting warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.64,0:50:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.36,0:51:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.32,0:51:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.08,0:51:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,三号守护人 我们找到了俄罗斯潜艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guardian 3, we located your Russian sub.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.64,0:51:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个不可思议的发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna believe what else we found.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.88,0:51:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.80,0:51:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,能看到潜艇在树木上方二三十米高\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears to be rising approximately 20 to 30 meters…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.96,0:51:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看的很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}…above the tree line.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.24,0:51:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,目测不出宽度\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't tell how wide it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.04,0:51:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这秘密守不住了 别想着保密了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cat's out of the bag, doctor. No more secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.96,0:51:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在最重要的就是安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our highest priority now is safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.40,0:51:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那岛上有将近一百万人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's close to a million people on that island.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.68,0:51:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,派人在空中盯着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me eyes in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.00,0:51:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,监测到不明物体 从太平洋方向逼近\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're picking up something else. Approaching from the Pacific.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.32,0:51:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上查明到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to check out that object.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.44,0:51:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入全面戒备\N{\fnArial\fs30}General quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.12,0:51:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰桥 我是舰长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridge, this is the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.88,0:52:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪儿 - 去飞行甲板\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where you going? - Up to the flight deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.20,0:52:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是它来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.80,0:52:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.20,0:52:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去看一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.52,0:53:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫二号 正在接近目标 准备行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two Charlie Six, we are circling the target. Go on your command.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.68,0:53:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经发现目标 十二点方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by, got a visual. Bogey at my 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.48,0:53:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 注意观察 随时准备开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be advised. Prepare to engage target.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.40,0:53:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,三号守护人 我们这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting movement…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.44,0:53:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}…down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.72,0:53:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意隐蔽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.88,0:53:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制中心 我失去了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control, I have…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.84,0:53:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,动力 重复 我失去了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…no power. I say again, I've lost all…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.80,0:53:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.32,0:53:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,等十秒钟灯就会亮起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give it 10 seconds, lights gonna come back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.64,0:53:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.64,0:54:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么 - 你看见没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was that? - Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.16,0:54:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.64,0:54:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.60,0:54:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.40,0:54:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoe!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.72,0:54:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.92,0:54:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑 快跑 是海啸 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run. Run! Tsunami! Tsunami!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.24,0:54:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,亡命徒 目标出现在海岸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target spotted offshore…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.32,0:54:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你的方位以东两海里 可能是另一只怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}…two knots due east of your position. Could be a second bogey.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.72,0:57:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人受伤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.24,0:57:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁看见它往哪儿去了 - 没看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anyone get an eyeball on the bogey? - Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.92,0:57:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.16,0:57:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.96,0:57:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}…please. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.20,0:57:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.16,0:58:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.00,0:58:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了您的安全…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember to stay…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.48,0:58:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,请勿倚靠车门\N{\fnArial\fs30}…clear of the doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.88,0:58:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.40,0:58:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现目标 两点钟方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target in sight…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.90,0:58:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 距离三百米 - 明白 我已经锁定目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …two o'clock, 300 meters. - We're on 6-X-01. Target confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.52,0:58:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.52,0:59:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,能告诉我们发生什么事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you tell us what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.32,0:59:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都开始奔跑尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}… and everybody started running and screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.76,0:59:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 把电视关了 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, please turn that TV off.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.20,0:59:45.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（檀香山几近毁灭）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.28,0:59:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见我说话了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, did you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.20,0:59:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.04,0:59:54.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（遇难檀香山… 萨拉托加号航空母舰部署）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.16,0:59:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了萨姆 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sammy. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.92,0:59:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,该睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. It's bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.88,1:00:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 - 妈妈 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sammy. - Mommy, look.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.40,1:00:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,大恐龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.04,1:00:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意 新进病人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention, please. Incoming patients…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.92,1:00:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请到… - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …please proceed… - Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.60,1:00:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Excuse me. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.24,1:00:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子跟父母走散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This boy's been separated from his parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.48,1:00:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,先把这表填了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fill this out. Be with you…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.66,1:00:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上来帮你解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.92,1:00:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手机能打出去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you got service on that cell phone?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.00,1:00:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 连公用电话都打不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. The pay phones don't even work.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.36,1:00:49.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（登记处）
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.88,1:00:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 昭夫 - 昭夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Akio! - Akio!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.64,1:00:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama! Papa!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.56,1:01:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corporal, load up, load up.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.68,1:01:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,中士 我是海军中尉布罗迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant. Lieutenant Brody, U.S. Navy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.00,1:01:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助 我要去内陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help. I'm trying to get to the mainland.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.64,1:01:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天算你走运 所有运输工具都往东面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your lucky day. Everything not tied down is moving east.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.56,1:01:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们往东跑了 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa, is that where they're heading? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.32,1:01:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在是专业打怪兽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we're monster hunters now.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.88,1:01:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星图像传送完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satellite transfer complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.52,1:01:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,模拟数据上传中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simulations uploaded.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.48,1:01:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星追踪继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satellite tracking continues.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.20,1:01:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,预计穆托会持续向东移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last satellite tracks predict the MUTO continuing due east.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.16,1:01:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,综合所有数据 目标会在太平洋沿岸相遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}All our models have the targets converging on the Pacific Coast.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.72,1:01:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前看 哥斯拉好像是在跟着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}As of now, it looks like Godzilla's still following the MUTO.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.16,1:01:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在狩猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hunting.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.04,1:01:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,让所有船舰跟目标保持目前的距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have all vessels maintain current distance from target.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.80,1:01:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录它们的速度和移动方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}And plot the speed and heading of these things.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.28,1:02:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要知道它们准确的登陆时间和方位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know exactly when and where they'll make landfall.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.12,1:02:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.64,1:02:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 您刚才说的狩猎是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, what did you mean by "hunting"?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.24,1:02:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得它是在追逐穆托吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's chasing this MUTO?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.64,1:02:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果穆托是它的目标猎物\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if the MUTO is his prey…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.68,1:02:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这信号是在召唤\N{\fnArial\fs30}The signal shows a call.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.44,1:02:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它为什么自找麻烦 - 不 不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why call up a predator? - No, it didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.72,1:02:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把哥斯拉招来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Godzilla…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.88,1:02:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是个意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}…was only listening.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.76,1:02:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,穆托肯定是在呼唤别的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The MUTO was calling something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.12,1:02:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那波形\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pattern.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.36,1:02:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意搜寻内华达州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Focus the search on Nevada.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.24,1:02:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,内华达 它怎么会去内华达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nevada? Why would it go to Nevada?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.32,1:02:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不可能 绝不可能 - 什么不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It can't be. It's impossible. - What's impossible?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.24,1:02:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个完好无损的孢子体 在菲律宾矿场找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was another spore, intact, found in the Philippine mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.76,1:02:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们把它解剖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we vivisected it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.60,1:02:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿它做了好几年的实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ran every test on it for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.64,1:02:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你亲自确认的 它是休眠的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You confirmed it for yourself. It was dormant!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.64,1:02:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许现在不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.48,1:02:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个孢子现在在哪儿 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}This spore. Where is it now, doctor?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.88,1:02:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西辐射很大 被摧毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was highly radioactive. It was disposed of.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.88,1:02:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,被美国人拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Americans, they took it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.52,1:02:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 它在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.72,1:03:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们存放核废料的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you put all your nuclear waste.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.48,1:03:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.24,1:03:28.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（尤卡山核废料存放处）
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.36,1:03:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, let's go! Give me a Mark I…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.40,1:03:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一间库房都要仔细检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}…eyeball on every vault.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.44,1:03:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.96,1:03:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.36,1:03:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.24,1:03:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安全 - 安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clear! - Clear!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.36,1:03:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.00,1:03:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安全 - 安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clear! - Clear!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.04,1:03:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.68,1:04:30.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（即时新闻）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.08,1:04:35.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（直播 拉斯维加斯陷入恐慌）
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.16,1:04:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anyone in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.76,1:05:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰长 无人驾驶机拍到了新穆托的图像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, our UAVs have footage of the new MUTO.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.12,1:05:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,转到大屏幕上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.32,1:05:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.60,1:05:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是五分钟前拍到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is from five minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.32,1:05:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.40,1:05:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部放一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playing all we have now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.28,1:05:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,近三百英尺高\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost 300 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.16,1:05:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,比另一个大多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's far bigger than the other one.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.48,1:05:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这只没有翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this one doesn't have any wings.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.60,1:05:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不同性别\N{\fnArial\fs30}A different sex?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.24,1:05:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是雌性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A female.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.88,1:05:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是在召唤它\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's who he's been talking to.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.08,1:05:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是在求偶\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be a mating call.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.92,1:05:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,雌性保持休眠状态等待雄性成熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The female remained dormant until the male matured.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.40,1:05:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在寻找放射物质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they're seeking radiation.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.32,1:05:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,以保障繁殖\N{\fnArial\fs30}To reproduce.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.16,1:06:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,综合所有数据分析 三个目标将在这里会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Current tracking models indicate that all three targets are converging here:
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.92,1:06:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧金山海湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}San Francisco Bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.28,1:06:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果把安装防护计时器的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if we rig a nuclear warhead with a shielded timer…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.84,1:06:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,核弹头安装在船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}…put it on a boat and send it…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.22,1:06:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,让船距离海岸二十英里之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}…20 miles out…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.44,1:06:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,用它的放射性来吸引穆托\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the radiation lures the MUTOs…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.84,1:06:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,穆托会引来哥斯拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the MUTOs lure Godzilla.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.80,1:06:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后引爆核弹 这样对城市的损害最小\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we detonate, with minimal fallout risk to the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.04,1:06:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吧 它们就吃这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be serious. They feed on radiation.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.08,1:06:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 所以才用核弹当诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correct. That's why we use the bomb as bait.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.76,1:06:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸会直接…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And kill them…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.12,1:06:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 解决掉它们 - 简直是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …with the sheer force of the blast. - This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.52,1:06:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 如果你还有别的办法 我们洗耳恭听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, if you have any other ideas, I am all ears.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.60,1:06:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.60,1:06:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 请讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, doctor?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.48,1:06:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉也许就是答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gojira may be the answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.52,1:06:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.52,1:06:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,它来这儿就是为了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he's here to restore balance.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.56,1:06:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能战胜它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can defeat them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.28,1:06:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说 我们只能袖手旁观\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what? We just stand by and watch?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.08,1:06:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 博士 我不能冒这个险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, doctor. I can't take that risk.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.92,1:06:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,去准备核弹 马上运往海岸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prep the warheads and get them moving to the coast.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.00,1:06:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 长官 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.80,1:07:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 我知道你不赞成这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you don't agree with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.96,1:07:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我首先考虑的是保护我们的市民\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my first priority is to safeguard our citizens.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.64,1:07:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这表停了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stopped.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.16,1:07:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.12,1:07:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,1945年8月6号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight-fifteen in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.72,1:07:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,上午八点十五分\N{\fnArial\fs30}August 6, 1945.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.76,1:07:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,广岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiroshima.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.72,1:07:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我父亲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my father's.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.52,1:07:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,都听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.56,1:07:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚接到命令 我们有了新的目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got new destination, new orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.80,1:07:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上调整装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get geared up.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.96,1:07:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,上士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, tech sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.20,1:08:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the word?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.28,1:08:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在内华达又发现了一个那种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another one of those things popped up in Nevada, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.00,1:08:22.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加利福尼亚州 孤松镇）
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.84,1:08:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 大家下车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, everybody out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.32,1:08:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能到这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't fly any further.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.56,1:08:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经进入电磁脉冲的射程了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're well in range of its EMP.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.60,1:08:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以接下来的路程 只能靠我们的两条腿了 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So from here on out, it's on the ground or it's not at all. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.56,1:08:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 都听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.88,1:08:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这列火车和这些武器将被运往旧金山\N{\fnArial\fs30}This train and these weapons are headed to San Francisco.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.52,1:09:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟这项任务无关的人 立即下车 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone not part of this mission, disembark now!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.08,1:09:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.48,1:09:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't do it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.60,1:09:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是项高风险任务 那列火车是国有资产 不是美铁公司的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a high-risk mission. That train is a national asset, not Amtrak.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.56,1:09:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能走了吗 - 准备就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We good to go? - Just about.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.12,1:09:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这些民兵洲际弹道导弹的弹壳看\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the look of the casings on those Minuteman ICBMs…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.16,1:09:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜数码模块被彻底忽略了 准备全面模拟改造吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…guessing the digital module's been bypassed and you're prepping for full analog retrofit.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.56,1:09:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我就会让你上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is my jaw supposed to drop?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.36,1:09:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 你是拆弹专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. You're EOD.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.08,1:09:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有人了 他们知道怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got my crew, they know what they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.96,1:09:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,尖头对准妖怪 对吗 军士长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aim the pointy end at the monsters, right, sarge?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.12,1:09:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的人到底多长时间没摸过炸弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time you let one of your guys put their fingers in a live bomb?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.04,1:09:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我是干这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this is what I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.72,1:09:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my job.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.32,1:09:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,军士长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.32,1:09:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家就在城里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family's in the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.64,1:09:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我必须坐上那列火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I need to get on that train.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.40,1:09:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才发言人已经明确表示\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard the spokesman say…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.28,1:09:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,白宫并不排除动用核武的可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that the White House has not ruled out the use of nuclear force.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.44,1:09:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你妈妈一会儿就过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, your mom's gonna be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.92,1:10:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,急救中心 什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency, can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.04,1:10:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.40,1:10:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 请稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, just a sec.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.56,1:10:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽 找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elle, for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.92,1:10:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 马上来 - 艾丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell them I'll be there in a minute. - Elle.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.76,1:10:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.52,1:10:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.52,1:10:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elle?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.52,1:10:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,福特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ford?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.20,1:10:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.52,1:10:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 萨姆呢 - 我一直在到处打电话找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? How's Sam? - I've been calling you everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.60,1:10:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay'? - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.88,1:10:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我和萨姆在一起 - 太好了 我最担心的就是你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've got Sam with me. - Great. Because I wanna get you both…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.32,1:10:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't believe this is happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.84,1:10:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,福特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ford.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.24,1:10:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay? Are you doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.96,1:10:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 艾丽 别担心我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. Elle, please don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.48,1:10:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我好怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, I'm so scared right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.68,1:10:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.36,1:10:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,天亮的时候我就会到医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be at the hospital by sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.32,1:10:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把你和萨姆接出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll get you and Sam out.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.76,1:10:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.76,1:10:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,军队有办法对付这些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}The military has a plan to deal with these things.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.48,1:10:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会来接你们俩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming to get you both, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.28,1:10:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.44,1:10:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能快点儿来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you please just hurry?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.24,1:11:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I Will.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.60,1:11:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elle?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.36,1:11:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是想告诉你 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted you to know that I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.36,1:11:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你 你小心点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you too. Just be safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.92,1:11:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.80,1:11:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,中尉 快上车 出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to go! Let's move out!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.84,1:11:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,受电子干扰停电的区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}As blackouts and electrical interference…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.84,1:11:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,逐渐向西扩大\N{\fnArial\fs30}…radiate farther and farther west…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.60,1:11:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物周围两百英里范围内的 居民均受到严重影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}…citizens within 200 miles of the creature's current sphere of influence…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.44,1:11:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府方面敦促大家尽快找到避难场所\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are being urged to please find shelter…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.72,1:11:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要出门 不要停留在街道上\N{\fnArial\fs30}…stay indoors and stay off the roads.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.28,1:11:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,911 您有什么事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}911, what's your emergency?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.20,1:11:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子还在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}…kids in the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.88,1:11:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,碎片涉及大约两英里左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}…debris going back about two miles.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.84,1:11:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩没有呼吸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This girl is not breathing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.40,1:12:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,受伤的人 你必须派人来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}… people that are hurt. Send somebody out here now!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.68,1:12:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.96,1:12:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹头已经在路上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, warheads are on the move.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.72,1:12:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全同意 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I completely agree, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.80,1:12:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了各位 开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, people. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.32,1:12:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要第一时间知道穆托的确切位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know the exact location of the MUTOs ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.20,1:12:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官 正在更新最新的实时数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye. We're updating our models with the current tracking data now.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.68,1:12:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.56,1:12:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.56,1:12:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.04,1:12:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在担心什么 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand your concerns, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.72,1:12:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了把这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am sacrificing lives…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.32,1:12:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,引离人口密集地区 每一分钟都有人在送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}…every minute trying to steer one of these things clear of population centers…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.96,1:12:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在又有两头 正在来的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and now there are two more on the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.36,1:12:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,几百万人危在旦夕 所以我希望…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are millions of lives at risk. So all I want to know…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.76,1:12:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能告诉我的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}…from you is:
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.00,1:12:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有用吗 杀得了它们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will it work and can they be killed?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.40,1:12:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我们以前试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we tried that before.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.04,1:12:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以调整重量 百万吨级 不是千吨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking dialable yield. Megatons, not kilotons.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.92,1:12:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么能抵挡这种威力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing can withstand that blast.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.76,1:13:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,五四年用来杀它的不过是小鞭炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes the bomb we tried to kill it with in '54 look like a firecracker.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.16,1:13:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马勒斯中士 帮个忙 - 我还以为这东西…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sergeant Morales. Give me a hand. - I thought these nukes…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.20,1:13:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是遥控引爆的呢 - 穆托会干扰…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …all detonated by remote control. - The MUTOs knock out…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.12,1:13:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的电子设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}…everything electric.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.48,1:13:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括起爆器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including detonators.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.32,1:13:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以没等导弹进入射程就全失灵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't even get in range without these things going haywire.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.36,1:13:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.64,1:13:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是另一个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, on the other hand, is old-school.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.28,1:13:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,老式的机械计时器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clockwork.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.68,1:13:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻轻一按…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes a licking…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.92,1:13:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上开转\N{\fnArial\fs30}…keeps on ticking.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.16,1:13:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.28,1:14:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,马勒斯中士 带着无线电下来 动作快点儿 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant Morales, get down here with that radio. On the double. Move, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.76,1:14:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇眼 亡命徒呼叫十一月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snake Eyes, this is Bravo to November. ls the bridge…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.60,1:14:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,桥梁安全吗 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}…clear? Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.96,1:14:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say again:
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.16,1:14:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辆装满特需货物的火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a train of VIP cargo…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.08,1:14:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,驶向海岸线 桥梁安全吗 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}…headed for the coast. Is the bridge clear? Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.92,1:14:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛇眼 收到请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snake Eyes, I need a sitrep.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.44,1:14:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁路安全吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are the tracks clear?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.08,1:14:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们选择处于黄色警戒 十分钟后将进入红色警戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are at phase line yellow. In the next 10 mikes, we're advancing to phase line red.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.24,1:14:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否安全 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secure or not? Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.60,1:15:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得桥还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it's intact?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.92,1:15:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个办法能确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.96,1:15:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你负责上面 - 行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You wanna take the top? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.72,1:15:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你负责下面 马勒斯中士 你跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You check below. Sergeant Morales, you come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.72,1:15:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.76,1:15:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.72,1:15:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 琼斯 你没事吧 - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jones, you all right? - Yeah, I'm good!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.36,1:16:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,桥梁完好无损\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bridge is intact.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.92,1:16:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛头犬 我是老鹰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bulldog, this is Eagle.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.36,1:16:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以行动 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}All clear to move out. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.00,1:16:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 老鹰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that, Eagle.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.44,1:16:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车 大家上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Let's go, people!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.96,1:16:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,请重复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say again.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.16,1:16:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不见你们 在什么位置 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not have a visual. What is your position? Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.72,1:16:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听不清楚 请重复 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unreadable. Say again. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.32,1:16:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快卧倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit the deck.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.64,1:17:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快帮我关上它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me turn it off, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.00,1:18:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.92,1:18:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.72,1:18:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,福特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ford! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.36,1:18:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,它下水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going under!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.52,1:18:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰队 拉响碰撞警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boats, sound the collision alarm.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.00,1:18:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百八十幅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frame 180.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.48,1:19:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法获取图像 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're losing visual, admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.72,1:19:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在潜水\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's diving.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.48,1:19:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变航向移动迅速 时速达到三十三节 而且还在提速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Changing course and moving fast. I've got him at 33 knots and picking up speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.48,1:19:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我们快多了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna outrun us, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.00,1:20:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持平稳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the swinging!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.48,1:20:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要晃\N{\fnArial\fs30}No swing!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.08,1:20:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.20,1:20:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.84,1:20:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,医务兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medic!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.44,1:20:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在赶往当地的公交站\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are insisting civilians make their way to the BART stations.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.96,1:20:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有车站 都已成了临时避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}BART stations are designated shelters.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.84,1:20:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这些病人是我负责照顾的 你要带他们去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}These patients are my responsibility. Where are you taking them?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.12,1:20:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他们出城 只带重患和儿童\N{\fnArial\fs30}Across the bridges. Critical and children only.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.52,1:20:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,避难所马上就满了 相信我 他们去城外会更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shelters are gonna fill up fast. Trust me, they'll be safer outside the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.12,1:20:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我带着萨姆 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can take Sam. - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.00,1:20:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,福特马上就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ford's on his way.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.00,1:20:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你改主意 大巴十分钟后离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you change your mind, the buses leave in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.72,1:20:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿福特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Where are you, Ford?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.08,1:20:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 让他们快点儿 快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way! Keep them moving!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.04,1:20:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.12,1:21:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,要把它弄哪儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Where are they taking it?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.64,1:21:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,离海岸二十英里的地方 最佳聚集点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty miles offshore, convergence point.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.48,1:21:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它们引到那儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna lure them there.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.16,1:21:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能一石三鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three birds, one stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.12,1:21:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.20,1:21:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.88,1:21:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉 感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laura, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.36,1:21:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 记得劳拉吧 妈妈的同事 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, you remember Laura. She's Mommy's work friend, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.72,1:21:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会替妈妈照顾你一小会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna look after you for a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.00,1:21:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸马上就来接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy's gonna be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.48,1:21:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈也会很快来找你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna just come get you right after.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.96,1:21:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.40,1:21:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.04,1:21:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.80,1:22:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 宝贝儿 跟我在一起吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, sweetheart. You're gonna come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.32,1:22:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈要留下照顾病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom's gonna stay and help.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.96,1:22:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽 我会照顾好他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elle, I'm gonna take care of him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.44,1:22:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放心 跟妈妈再见吧 - 再见 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Say, "Bye-bye, Mommy." - Bye, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.52,1:22:27.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加利福尼亚州 奥克兰市 战术指挥部）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.40,1:22:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him! I got him!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.96,1:22:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这边坐下 坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just sit down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.44,1:22:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit, sit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.84,1:22:44.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（旧金山火警救援）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.88,1:22:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.72,1:22:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你意识清醒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you lose consciousness?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.16,1:22:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 真的没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. Really, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.04,1:22:50.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（奥克兰市海湾区公园）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.72,1:22:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告情况 目标现在的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sitrep, please. Location of targets?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.80,1:22:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,雄性穆托在靠近 费拉隆群岛三十英里的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Male MUTO was spotted 30 miles off the Farallon Islands.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.64,1:23:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,东部靠近利弗莫尔的地区有地壳震动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Showing seismic activity to the east near Livermore.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.40,1:23:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是雌性导致的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should be the female closing in.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.16,1:23:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥斯拉在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Godzilla?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.04,1:23:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一次记录还是五小时之前的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last contact was five hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.76,1:23:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,方向零五三 深度一万英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maintaining a bearing of 053 degrees, descending below a depth of 10, 000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.28,1:23:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,用不了一小时就能到达这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be here within the hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.52,1:23:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,居民们正在想尽一切办法撤离城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Residents are trying to get out of the city any way they can.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.84,1:23:14.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西海岸市民紧急疏散）
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.08,1:23:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,桥上还有好几辆大巴车\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still buses on that bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.40,1:23:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.68,1:23:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让大巴士快点儿开走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get those busses through. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.48,1:23:31.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警戒线 请勿穿越）
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.88,1:23:33.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警察）
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.64,1:23:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把车停在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna stop the buses here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.48,1:23:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.40,1:23:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不见 孩子们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't hear you. Oh, kids…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.96,1:23:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静点儿 别吵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…please be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.36,1:24:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,移动到位 直到你能瞄准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move into position till you have a clean line of sight!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.88,1:24:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,左舷两百米处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Portside! Two hundred meters!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.28,1:25:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brace!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.12,1:25:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.76,1:25:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.80,1:25:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.64,1:25:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.64,1:25:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold on! - Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.32,1:25:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire! Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.44,1:25:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.76,1:25:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴在座位上 快 趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down! Get down in your seats!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.68,1:25:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 快让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.08,1:25:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way! Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.12,1:25:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.40,1:25:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move out! Move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.36,1:26:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 桥上有平民 别开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Striker! There's civilians on the bridge. Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.00,1:26:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.80,1:26:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.68,1:27:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 到达目的地 - 核弹发射准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, get in there! - Prepare to arm the device!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.84,1:27:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready! You got it?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.64,1:27:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all set.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.80,1:27:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,插入钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arming keys!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.28,1:27:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three! Two! One!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.52,1:27:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.04,1:27:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,脉冲干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}EMF.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.20,1:27:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,引擎停了 失去动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engine's stopped! We lost power!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.16,1:28:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事吧 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.72,1:28:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上面 - 开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fire! - Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.12,1:30:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·布罗迪一小时前被送到了奥克兰体育场避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Brody was checked into the Oakland Coliseum shelter an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.41,1:30:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.36,1:30:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没有艾丽·布罗迪的记录 应该还在城里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No record of Elle Brody. Never made it out of the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.20,1:30:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,再查一遍 求你了 我让她等我但我没赶到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, check again. Please. I told her to wait for me, and I didn't make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.44,1:30:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 滞留在城里的人 都被转移到地铁避难所了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are trying to get everyone downtown into subway shelters.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.64,1:30:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太太不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure your wife is fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.88,1:30:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,布罗迪中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant Brody!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.12,1:30:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找布罗迪中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for Lieutenant Brody.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.96,1:30:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是布罗迪吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you Brody? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.04,1:30:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 都听着 雄性怪物把弹头弄到了市中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. The male delivered the warhead to the center of downtown.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.56,1:30:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味着十万平民 会在爆炸中受到辐射\N{\fnArial\fs30}That puts 100, 000 civilians in the blast radius.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.92,1:30:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但又无法远程解除\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't stop it remotely.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.08,1:30:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,模拟定时器已经安装\N{\fnArial\fs30}An analog timer has been installed.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.25,1:30:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠近穆托五英里的范围内所有电子设备都将失灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}The MUTOs are frying electronics within a five-mile bubble.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.36,1:30:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说不可能从地面接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means approaching from ground is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.44,1:30:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能以高跳低开的方式空降\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we'll be conducting a HALO insertion. Jumping altitude…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.48,1:30:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳伞高度将在三万英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Will be 30, 000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.16,1:30:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,滑翔到正上方实施 这儿 还有这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just skate to the top and drop. Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.84,1:30:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没撞到摩天大楼 就在集结点C会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here. If you don't hit a skyscraper on the way, meet at rally point Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.96,1:30:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就在这儿 明白 - 博士 你有什么好建议吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right here. Good? - Doctor, any guesses where to look?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.88,1:30:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,查找地下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Underground.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.40,1:30:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果穆托已经产卵\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the MUTOs have spawned…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.32,1:30:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们肯定会筑巢\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they'll be building a nest.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.28,1:31:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉 一旦找到了弹头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, when you find the warhead…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.04,1:31:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多久能拆除 - 长官 不知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …how long to disarm it? - Without seeing…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.16,1:31:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 模拟定时器的模式前我无法预测 - 如果能找到它…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …the analog mod, I couldn't even guess. - Sixty seconds…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.32,1:31:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,六十秒足够\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if I can access it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.20,1:31:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲手改动过那个装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I retrofitted that device myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.20,1:31:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,布罗迪中尉是火车事故中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant Brody is our only…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.92,1:31:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一幸存的拆弹专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}…EOD tech to survive the train attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.32,1:31:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来全指望你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it sounds like we could use you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.44,1:31:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,说句不吉利的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.72,1:31:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果计划失败 有备用方案吗 - 海滩的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …if that doesn't work, then what's Plan B? - The waterfront…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.88,1:31:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在山下一公里处\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is located one klick downhill.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.04,1:31:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它弄到码头上 装上船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the bomb to the pier, onto a boat…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.24,1:31:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在爆炸之前 开得离城市越远越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and as far away from the city as possible before it detonates.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.04,1:31:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.40,1:31:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 解散吧 - 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dismissed. - That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.68,1:31:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.00,1:31:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.56,1:31:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能你还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've already been briefed.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.52,1:31:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次没有接应计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no extraction plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.40,1:31:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没及时撤离 就永远留在那儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't walk out, you don't come back at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.56,1:31:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会全力以赴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I'll do whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.68,1:32:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的这个掠食者之王 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}This alpha predator of yours, doctor…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.52,1:32:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得有获胜的可能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…do you really think he has a chance?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.28,1:32:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类总自以为是地认为控制了大自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}The arrogance of man is thinking nature is in our control…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.64,1:32:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰好相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and not the other way around.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.16,1:32:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它们斗吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.00,1:33:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,万能的主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Lord God, we give thanks…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.24,1:33:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你给予我们这样的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for the opportunities you have given us…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.36,1:33:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们共同为国家而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}…going together as comrades to defend our great nation.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.48,1:33:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你给予我们一起服役的美好时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thank you for the time and service that you have given us together.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.00,1:33:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们即将奔赴战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now as we are about to leave one another…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.24,1:33:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,请给予我们力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}…let us have the strength…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.92,1:36:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take position! Take position!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.72,1:36:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见第一小队往东去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw Team 1 move to the east.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.64,1:36:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们小队损失俩人 无线电断断续续的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two of our team members didn't make it. I heard bits and pieces on the radio.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.88,1:36:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,狙击手在屋顶已经就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snipers on the rooftop moving into position.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.00,1:36:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了 找到弹头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. Picking up the nuke.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.76,1:36:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.60,1:36:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在山上一公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}One klick up the hill.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.00,1:36:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 找到弹头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found the warhead.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.16,1:36:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动吧 在山上 这个方向 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Up the hill, this direction. Move.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.52,1:37:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.32,1:37:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.28,1:38:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move, let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.24,1:38:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟在我后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my six.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.32,1:39:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,中士 你看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarge, get a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.00,1:39:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续前进 找到信号了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get moving. You got a signal yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.32,1:39:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.52,1:39:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.28,1:39:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.04,1:39:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab a line!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.12,1:39:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,照亮点儿 格雷泽\N{\fnArial\fs30}More light. Grazer.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.72,1:40:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 当心点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, clear out.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.76,1:40:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.44,1:40:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心点儿 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, look out, heads up!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.44,1:40:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还剩多少时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much time we got left?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.00,1:40:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有二十七分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have 27 mikes.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.60,1:40:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,得把它弄下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get this thing down.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.44,1:40:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move, I got you!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.52,1:40:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it out, move it out!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.96,1:41:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful! Careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.80,1:41:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起放 三…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And down in three…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.52,1:41:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,二…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…two…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.32,1:41:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}…one.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.72,1:41:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把盖子打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get this cover off.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.12,1:41:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 中尉看你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.80,1:41:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄不动 封死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not budging. It's sealed shut.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.56,1:41:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要时间打开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need time to open it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.72,1:41:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了 快把它弄出去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.84,1:41:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,装上船运走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get it on a boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.44,1:41:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家抓住弹头 一起用力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab the warhead! Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.28,1:41:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,钻过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.84,1:41:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,抬稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.12,1:41:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,抬稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.32,1:41:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 兄弟们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it out, guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.28,1:41:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,中尉 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.04,1:42:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.44,1:44:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.76,1:44:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit! Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.48,1:44:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.04,1:45:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 再快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster, faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.48,1:45:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快发动引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get this thing started.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.20,1:45:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到引擎开关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the ignition, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.68,1:45:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,把包给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that pack.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.48,1:45:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.80,1:45:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.72,1:45:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快上来 快上来 快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry it up. Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.00,1:45:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是奔核弹来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's coming for the bomb!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.76,1:45:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,把核弹绑结实了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get this weapon secured.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.00,1:48:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unh! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.96,1:48:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.84,1:48:47.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（卫星定位系统）
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.72,1:48:48.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（自动导航）
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.16,1:48:59.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（星际旅行号）
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.08,1:52:45.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（数千人仍然下落不明）
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.00,1:53:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这儿别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.40,1:53:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.00,1:53:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.88,1:53:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有声音 在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear some people. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.20,1:53:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住我的手 我们来救你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's in bad shape. Come on, grab my hand. We got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.32,1:53:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉他上来 拉上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help him up. Help him up.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.28,1:53:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,新到者请注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention, new arrivals:
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.12,1:53:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,请前往设有标记的桌子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please proceed to the marked tables…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.88,1:53:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 注册登记 - 请让条道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …for registration. - Let's make some room, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.52,1:53:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.96,1:53:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.52,1:54:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.76,1:54:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.24,1:54:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.80,1:54:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy! Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.24,1:54:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetpea.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.64,1:54:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.40,1:54:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.84,1:54:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.00,1:55:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.64,1:55:12.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（怪兽之王 城市救星）
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.16,2:02:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,[谨以此片纪念理查·福克斯以及杰克·福斯特]
